00:45:11,571 --> 00:45:14,726
Panggil aku bila dah siap.

720
00:45:14,749 --> 00:45:17,383
Okey~

721
00:45:17,406 --> 00:45:18,906
Senario 20: Neraka Kerja Lewat / Rutin Harian Neraka Lembur

722
00:45:18,906 --> 00:45:23,063
Aduh, hari ini penat betul.

723
00:45:23,086 --> 00:45:25,860
Betul juga.

724
00:45:25,883 --> 00:45:30,117
Baru-baru ni, selalu saja kerja lewat.

725
00:45:30,140 --> 00:45:34,077
Semalam balik pukul berapa?

726
00:45:34,100 --> 00:45:37,576
Pukul sebelas malam.

727
00:45:37,600 --> 00:45:41,953
Ketua suruh kerja sampai lewat.

728
00:45:41,976 --> 00:45:45,730
Pasti sangat menyusahkan.

729
00:45:45,753 --> 00:45:50,656
Suruh tulis semula semua dokumen.

730
00:45:50,679 --> 00:45:54,394
Eh, semua ke?

731
00:45:54,418 --> 00:45:59,085
Ya, betul-betul jemu dah.

732
00:45:59,108 --> 00:46:06,014
Setiap hari kerja macam ni, badan tak tahan la.

733
00:46:06,037 --> 00:46:11,072
Ya, walau macam mana pun tidur, rasa penat tak hilang.

734
00:46:11,095 --> 00:46:14,329
Hujung minggu pun kena kerja ke?

735
00:46:14,352 --> 00:46:19,018
Ahad pun kena datang pejabat.

736
00:46:19,041 --> 00:46:22,584
Tak ada cuti langsung ke?

737
00:46:22,607 --> 00:46:25,274
Memanglah.

738
00:46:25,297 --> 00:46:28,730
Ingin betul rehat dengan tenang.

739
00:46:28,753 --> 00:46:34,312
Walau mengadu pada atasan, tak ada perubahan pun.

740
00:46:34,336 --> 00:46:38,769
Ya, rasa macam mengadu pun tak guna.

741
00:46:38,792 --> 00:46:45,826
Saya pun baru-baru ni dapat banyak tugas baru.

742
00:46:45,850 --> 00:46:48,528
Kita sama-sama susah la ni.

743
00:46:48,551 --> 00:46:53,733
Bulan depan, saya akan balik tepat waktu.

744
00:46:53,757 --> 00:46:57,590
Eh, betul ke boleh balik awal?

745
00:46:57,613 --> 00:47:04,164
Ya, walau macam mana sibuk pun, masa untuk diri sendiri penting.

746
00:47:04,188 --> 00:47:07,621
Itu keputusan yang bagus.

747
00:47:07,644 --> 00:47:12,439
Hidup kerja saja memang tak best.

748
00:47:12,463 --> 00:47:17,797
Saya pun nak mula tolak kerja yang tak perlu.

749
00:47:17,820 --> 00:47:23,486
Betul tu. Kalau tak mampu, cakap tak mampu.

750
00:47:23,509 --> 00:47:28,818
Ya, kesihatan diri yang paling penting.

751
00:47:28,842 --> 00:47:33,175
Jom balik awal hari ni?

752
00:47:33,198 --> 00:47:38,376
Setuju. Hari ni kita balik awal.

753
00:47:38,400 --> 00:47:40,916
Terima kasih atas kerja keras anda.

754
00:47:40,940 --> 00:47:43,933
